e_normalized_df = credit_df[[\'Balance_normalized\']].copy()\n\n# Save to CSV files\nincome_normalized_df.to_csv(income_normalized_path, index=False)\nbalance_normalized_df.to_csv(balance_normalized_path, index=False)\n\nprint(f"Income normalized file saved to: {income_normalized_path}")\nprint(f"Balance normalized file saved to: {balance_normalized_path}")\n\n# Verify files were created\nimport os\nprint(f"\\nIncome file exists: {os.path.exists(income_normalized_path)}")\nprint(f"Balance file exists: {os.path.exists(balance_normalized_path)}")\n```\n```python\n# Round min/max values to 2 decimal places for final output\nincome_min_rounded = round(income_min, 2)\nincome_max_rounded = round(income_max, 2)\nbalance_min_rounded = round(balance_min, 2)\nbalance_max_rounded = round(balance_max, 2)\n\n# Get the mode of Education column\neducation_mode = int(credit_df[\'Education\'].mode()[0])\n\nprint(f"\\n=== Final Values for Output ===")\nprint(f"education_mode: {education_mode}")\nprint(f"income_min_val: {income_min_rounded}")\nprint(f"income_max_val: {income_max_rounded}")\nprint(f"balance_min_val: {balance_min_rounded}")\nprint(f"balance_max_val: {balance_max_rounded}")\nprint(f"income_normalized_file_path: {income_normalized_path}")\nprint(f"balance_normalized_file_path: {balance_normalized_path}")\n```\nTime consumed: 0.01s\nCode output:\nExit Code: 0\nOutput: \nIncome normalized range: [0.0000, 1.0000]\nBalance normalized range: [0.0000, 1.0000]\n\nTime consumed: 0.01s\nCode output:\nExit Code: 0\nOutput: \nIncome normalized file saved to: ./working/income_normalized.csv\nBalance normalized file saved to: ./working/balance_normalized.csv\n\nIncome file exists: True\nBalance file exists: True\n\nTime consumed: 0.01s\nCode output:\nExit Code: 0\nOutput: \n\n=== Final Values for Output ===\neducation_mode: 16\nincome_min_val: 10.35\nincome_max_val: 186.63\nbalance_min_val: 0\nbalance_max_val: 1999\nincome_normalized_file_path: ./working/income_normalized.csv\nbalance