rkdown\n# Verification\n- Required columns (PassengerId, Fare): ✓ Available in dataset\n- Sample size for analysis: {len(df_fare)} non-null Fare values\n- Method: IQR with 1.5*IQR threshold\n- Outlier count: {outlier_count}\n- Outlier IDs: {outlier_ids}\n```\n```markdown\n[STEP GOAL]: Format the final answer according to the required output format.\n```\n```markdown\n# Final Answer\nBased on the IQR method analysis:\n- Q1 = {Q1:.4f}\n- Q3 = {Q3:.4f}\n- IQR = {IQR:.4f}\n- Lower bound = {lower_bound:.4f}\n- Upper bound = {upper_bound:.4f}\n- Number of outliers = {outlier_count}\n- Outlier PassengerIds = {outlier_ids}\n```\n```markdown\n{\n  "final_answer_block": {\n    "question_id": 528,\n    "answers": {\n      "outlier_count": {outlier_count},\n      "outlier_ids": {outlier_ids}\n    },\n    "format_targets": {\n      "outlier_count": "@outlier_count[{outlier_count}]",\n      "outlier_ids": "@outlier_ids[{outlier_ids}]"\n    },\n    "evidence": {\n      "source_columns": ["PassengerId", "Fare"],\n      "sample_size": {len(df_fare)},\n      "method": "IQR method with 1.5*IQR threshold",\n      "oracle_evidence": {\n        "Q1": {Q1:.4f},\n        "Q3": {Q3:.4f},\n        "IQR": {IQR:.4f},\n        "lower_bound": {lower_bound:.4f},\n        "upper_bound": {upper_bound:.4f}\n      }\n    },\n    "verified": true,\n    "validator_report_id": null\n  }\n}\n```\nTime consumed: 0.02s\nCode output:\nExit Code: 0\nOutput: \nDataset shape: (418, 11)\n\nFare column info:\n  Missing values: 1\n  Non-null values: 417\n\nFare descriptive statistics:\ncount    417.000000\nmean      35.627188\nstd       55.907576\nmin        0.000000\n25%        7.895800\n50%       14.454200\n75%       31.500000\nmax      512.329200\nName: Fare, dtype: float64\n\nTime consumed: 0.01s\nCode output:\nExit Code: 0\nOutput: \nQ1 (25th percentile): 7.8958\nQ3 (75th percentile): 31.5000\nIQR: 23.6042\nLower bound: -27.5105\nUpper bound: 66.9063\n\nTime consumed: 0.01s\nCode output:\nExit Code: 0\nOutpu